    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "So you're basically saying that pursuing national interest is a recipe for economic collapse and isolation? That seems like a really extreme way to frame it. Doesn't every country have a fundamental right to prioritize its own citizens first? Why does the \"global order\" get to set the rules for what a country is allowed to do for its own people?",
